<alert xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:cap:1.2"><identifier>9c46f1ee-c145-4f09-877b-c41b031ec7d1</identifier><sender>PAGASA-DOST</sender><sent>2026-10-25T05:15:50+08:00</sent><status>Actual</status><msgType>Update</msgType><scope>Public</scope><references>PAGASA-DOST,fd4190b2-831e-46a4-9cb5-eae65f7a725c,2026-10-24T17:29:53+08:00</references><info><category>Met</category><event>General Flood Advisory (Final)</event><responseType>AllClear</responseType><urgency>Past</urgency><severity>Minor</severity><certainty>Unlikely</certainty><expires>2026-10-25T17:15:50+08:00</expires><senderName>PAGASA-DOST</senderName><headline>General Flood Advisory (Final)</headline><description>Under present weather conditions, Intertropical Convergence Zone (ITCZ) affecting Palawan, Visayas, and Mindanao.  
The 12-hour rainfall forecast is light rains and thunderstorms.  
WATERCOURSES NO LONGER TO BE AFFECTED :  

 + **Lanao Del Sur** - Rivers and its tributaries particularly Dapao and Matling.  
 + **Maguindanao** - Rivers and its tributaries particularly Nituan, Mindanao, Dalican, Allah, Buluan, Matuber, Mlang and Lower Mlang.  
</description><instruction>With this development and unless significant rain occurs, this is the final general flood advisory for this event.</instruction><web>http://www.pagasa.dost.gov.ph/index.php/26-hydromet/1582-flood-forecast-terms-and-symbols</web><contact>PAGASA-DOST</contact><parameter><valueName>layer:Google:Region:0.1</valueName><value>BARMM (Bangsamoro Autonomous Region of Muslim Mindanao)</value></parameter><area><areaDesc>Lanao Del Sur</areaDesc><polygon>7.7848171965635,124.30962483828 7.7860628345175,124.31313302625 8.0016053083799,124.28311576306 8.001190683192,124.15695334226 8.0579232076135,124.2638488863 8.2260605317188,124.31397566585 8.1187647090304,124.53460737082 8.0079628806503,124.59854194074 7.901010298366,124.59990712814 7.6108541816393,124.80915241862 7.6625661293833,124.44756585661 7.6059492752175,124.31278719462 7.4357721205093,124.15753984959 7.6343863668095,124.02795450809 7.6952898819786,123.85271560872 7.6945054948195,123.99054370854 7.9407753443272,124.12918610996 7.7848171965635,124.30962483828</polygon><geocode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>153600000</value></geocode></area><area><areaDesc>Maguindanao</areaDesc><polygon>7.0867919549048,124.43286590089 7.0276954153796,124.50349997173 7.0933213886909,124.81047330492 6.8204376062964,124.8248193819 6.7331976081862,124.99453374429 6.6413284007485,124.86168191004 6.6425676627641,124.86251421126 6.7556784445209,124.75702023048 6.854636813861,124.56120816767 6.727791168152,124.50481352299 6.746032379188,124.04183941448 6.8166802921236,123.95561737242 7.141572852018,124.06623002704 7.1923755274096,124.20472054181 7.0867919549048,124.43286590089</polygon><polygon>7.1280850263146,124.32032484318 7.1291852704755,124.3208730988 7.1678798526416,124.33842521438 7.1280850263146,124.32032484318</polygon><polygon>7.1716532363531,124.33828411177 7.2315683175387,124.23550849663 7.40694308334,124.25184368 7.4357721205093,124.15753984959 7.6059492752175,124.31278719462 7.6625661293833,124.44756585